---
const systems = [
  { label: 'Lâm sàng', icon: 'dentistry', className: 'framework-node-clinical' },
  { label: 'Đội ngũ', icon: 'groups', className: 'framework-node-team' },
  { label: 'Tăng trưởng', icon: 'trending_up', className: 'framework-node-growth' },
  { label: 'Tài chính', icon: 'account_balance_wallet', className: 'framework-node-finance' },
] as const;
---

<aside class="framework-visual" aria-label="Bản đồ hệ điều hành Dental Empire OS">
  <div class="framework-visual__ambient" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="framework-orbit framework-orbit--one"></span>
    <span class="framework-orbit framework-orbit--two"></span>
    <span class="framework-constellation framework-constellation--one"></span>
    <span class="framework-constellation framework-constellation--two"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Bản đồ hệ điều hành</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-xs text-xl font-black leading-snug text-on-surface">Một điểm nhìn chung cho mọi quyết định.</h2>
    </div>
    <span class="framework-core-icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">account_tree</span>
  </div>

  <div class="framework-system-map relative z-10" aria-label="Các hệ thống trong phòng khám">
    <svg class="framework-connectors" viewBox="0 0 400 270" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M200 135 L90 62 M200 135 L310 62 M200 135 L90 208 M200 135 L310 208" />
      <circle cx="200" cy="135" r="4" />
    </svg>

    <div class="framework-core" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined">hub</span>
      <span class="framework-core__pulse"></span>
      <span class="framework-core__label">DEOS</span>
    </div>

    {systems.map((system) => (
      <div class:list={['framework-node', system.className]}>
        <span class="framework-node__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">{system.icon}</span>
        <span class="framework-node__label">{system.label}</span>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-outline-variant/55 pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">south_east</span>
    <p>Từ chuyên môn đến lợi nhuận, các hệ thống cùng chạy theo một chuẩn vận hành.</p>
  </div>
</aside>
